english:
''My dear Lord Tenma. You must return to the mountain to attend the the senate of the Tengu. The invasion of Gensokyo has taken many and our people are in conflict. You must return, please. For our people.''

^#DBC5A6;DEF: +15% PSYCHIC.^reset;
^#F2B8EC;Warrior Caste [FULL SET 4x REQUIRED] - Successful Perfect-Parries will also automatically trigger effects that would've required a Special Melee Attack or Successful Counter-Attack | 5s cooldown.

korean:
''사랑하는 텐마 님이시여. 산으로 돌아가 텐구 의회에 참석하셔야 합니다. 환상향의 침공이 많은 이들을 데려갔고 우리 백성은 갈등 중입니다. 돌아와 주셔야 해요, 부디. 우리 백성을 위해.''

