english:
''Why the fuck are you wearing a bird's nest on your head?''

One important rule to using foliage as an element of your camouflage is to not overdo it. While it's a good idea to break up your silhouette to avoid detection, don't stick an entire bush into your helmet net. It looks dumb, and it makes you easier to spot when you move your head.
