english:
''The police can't protect you. Those that have reason to fear me had better sell out and give £10 to the widow and orphan fund. Neglect this and abide by the consequence which shall be worse than rust in wheat in Victoria or the drought of a dry season to the grasshoppers in New South Wales.''
